# Copy to apps/web/.env.local. Never commit real values.

# Where the SQLite DB and uploaded files live. Default: <repo>/data
# THOTH_DATA_DIR=

# Phase 1: only needed for the "anthropic-api" provider.
# The "claude-subscription" provider uses your logged-in `claude` CLI instead.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Phase 10 (doc 20): keys for OpenAI-compatible providers. Settings can save keys in the OS
# keychain instead; a variable set here always wins over a saved key.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=       used by profiles whose base URL is api.openai.com
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=   used by profiles whose base URL is openrouter.ai

# Phase 8: open Thoth from your phone with `pnpm start:lan`.
# Requests from this computer are never asked for it; every other device must enter it.
# At least 8 characters. Without it, other devices see a "set a passcode" page and no data.
# THOTH_PASSCODE=
# Optional. Signs the session cookie. Default: a random key stored in <data dir>/.session-secret
# THOTH_SECRET=
